WEBVTT

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.727
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>Part 2</b>

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:19.511
Mrs. Myers turned over the first card.

00:00:21.889 --> 00:00:29.326
“The seven of diamonds. That means money. You’re going to be rich!

00:00:32.187 --> 00:00:34.099
And the jack of hearts!

00:00:34.773 --> 00:00:40.849
That’s a good card. It means you’re going to meet a young man.”

00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:46.597
“Ah,” said Mrs. McCleary. “And what next?”

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:56.648
“The ten of spades,” said Mrs. Myers, as she turned over the third card.

00:00:57.578 --> 00:01:00.282
“That means you’re going to travel.

00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:06.653
But then,” she exclaimed,

00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:13.660
“we have the king of clubs! Clubs always mean problems.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:19.982
Somebody’s going to try to stop you. An old man…”

00:01:20.715 --> 00:01:24.885
“Probably my father!” Mrs. McCleary exclaimed.

00:01:25.613 --> 00:01:30.687
“But let’s look at the last card,” said Mrs. Myers.

00:01:33.147 --> 00:01:36.339
“Ah! The queen of hearts!

00:01:37.254 --> 00:01:40.640
You’re going to fall in love with the young man.

00:01:41.497 --> 00:01:50.170
Dear Miss Jones, in one year’s time, you’re going to marry a very rich young man,

00:01:50.817 --> 00:01:54.818
a businessman – he travels a lot.

00:01:55.778 --> 00:02:03.776
An old man is going to try to stop your marriage, but he’s not going to succeed.

00:02:04.782 --> 00:02:09.970
You’re going to move far away from here, probably abroad.

00:02:11.205 --> 00:02:14.190
That will be one pound, please.”

00:02:14.943 --> 00:02:18.495
“Thank you so much,” said Mrs. McCleary.

00:02:19.611 --> 00:02:24.645
She took a pound from her purse and gave it to Mrs. Myers.

00:02:25.438 --> 00:02:28.493
“Thank you,” said Mrs. Myers.

00:02:29.163 --> 00:02:31.811
“Goodbye, my dear Miss Jones…

00:02:32.858 --> 00:02:34.578
Next, please!”

00:02:42.566 --> 00:02:47.815
When Mrs. McCleary got home, she told her husband everything.

00:02:48.562 --> 00:02:52.383
“I don’t like it,” Inspector McCleary said.

00:02:53.014 --> 00:02:58.846
“What should we do about her? I know! I’ll report her.”

00:02:59.861 --> 00:03:02.924
And that’s what Inspector McCleary did.